telligent physical systems. The site offers a clinic finder, a knowledge center and ViMove+ training, research publications and an online store. A single Video AI module subscription costs 59 USD per month with a 28-day free trial.', 'Носимі сенсори ViMove+
Video AI для аналізу руху
